<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Thursday, Feb 27 used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Thursday     Feb 27   $69.11    up 0.06</p>
<p>Wednesday    Feb 26   $69.05    dn 0.05</p>
</text>
